  "new_radicals_added_this_product": [
    {
      "id": "photovoltaic_energy_function",
      "category": "function",
      "rationale": "Crystalline silicon solar cells convert photons to electrical current via the photovoltaic effect (p-n junction carrier separation). This function is irreducible to existing radicals: optical_sensing_function converts photons to a signal (detection), not a power output; electrical_conducting_function is a transport radical, not a conversion radical; silicon_semiconductor_function describes material function (transistors, gates) but not the photovoltaic power conversion mechanism. The radical is needed for the 55 m² solar array (c-Si panels), the MPPT charge controllers (which derive their purpose from the photovoltaic source), and any future PV product (flexible thin-film, CPV, etc.). This is a physically irreducible new radical: photon-to-electron conversion with nonzero efficiency."
    }
  ],
  "new_radicals_rationale": "1 new radical added: photovoltaic_energy_function. All other 24 HAPS lines decompose from the 21-radical post-AUV library. Key test cases resolved: (1) Solar cells (c-Si panel) — requires photovoltaic_energy_function. Could not be covered by optical_sensing_function (sensing, not power generation) or silicon_semiconductor_function (material class, not conversion function). (2) MPPT charge controller — reuses photovoltaic_energy_function (it exists to extract maximum power from a PV source) + existing power_converter + silicon_semiconductor_function. (3) CFRP spar + wing structure — composite_fibre_material covers all CFRP structural elements, same as drone week 4. (4) Variable-pitch propeller hub — electromechanical_switching_function + composite_fibre_material + fluid_flow_state covers; no new radical. (5) Stratospheric de-icing heater pad — electrical_conducting_function + thermal_transfer_function; existing electric_heater_element character suffices. (6) Ka-band steerable antenna — silicon_semiconductor_function + electrical_conducting_function covers GaN PA + feed network; satellite_comms_antenna character already exists from AUV. (7) Lithium-sulphur battery — electrochemical_energy_function covers all secondary cell chemistries (radical is chemistry-agnostic); new character for Li-S pack.",
